# P12 W4-0 (docs/design/sdk.md 6, 11.3, 12.2): the slice budget. The test
# game in mode 1 takes 30 ms a step against Class A's 20 ms: the first
# step logs "sdk viol badgame step", the repeat kills it ("sdk kill"):
# the Games list again with a pop slide, no splash, its .state not
# written. Mode 6 then draws from outside its memory: "sdk viol badgame
# arg" and the call does nothing (one violation, no kill).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-sdk-badgame-kill.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +3             # Game rule tests (below Bricks, Chess, Chute)
wait 600
sdk_bad 1
key SELECT           # Game rule tests
wait 2000
shot killed          # back on the Games list
sdk_bad 6
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot badarg          # still running: the label, mode 6
hold MENU 900
wait 1500
shot out
quit
